# HELP dbhealth_collection_duration_ms what the last interval cost
# HELP dbhealth_collection_errors queries that failed in the last interval
# HELP dbhealth_collection_queries queries the last interval ran
# HELP dbhealth_connections_max max_connections
# HELP dbhealth_connections_used connections in use
# HELP dbhealth_connections_waiting connections waiting on a lock
# HELP dbhealth_last_collect_timestamp_seconds when the last collection ran, Unix seconds
# HELP dbhealth_load_bytes_scanned_per_second storage read to answer queries
# HELP dbhealth_load_cache_hit_ratio the interval's reads served from memory, 0..1
# HELP dbhealth_load_deadlocks_per_second the interval's deadlocks
# HELP dbhealth_load_longest_query_seconds age of the oldest statement still running
# HELP dbhealth_load_queries_per_second the interval's queries
# HELP dbhealth_load_queries_queued_now queries waiting to start
# HELP dbhealth_load_rollbacks_per_second the interval's rollbacks
# HELP dbhealth_load_rows_read_per_second rows returned to clients
# HELP dbhealth_load_rows_written_per_second rows inserted, updated and deleted
# HELP dbhealth_load_sessions_active_now sessions executing a statement
# HELP dbhealth_load_sessions_idle_in_transaction_now sessions idle inside an open transaction
# HELP dbhealth_load_sessions_waiting_now sessions blocked on a lock, a queue or a resource
# HELP dbhealth_load_temp_bytes_per_second sorts and hashes spilling to disk
# HELP dbhealth_load_transactions_per_second the interval's commits
# HELP dbhealth_load_wal_bytes_per_second the write-ahead log the server wrote
# HELP dbhealth_memory_shared_buffers_bytes shared_buffers
# HELP dbhealth_oldest_transaction_seconds age of the oldest open transaction
# HELP dbhealth_partitions tables that are partitions
# HELP dbhealth_probe_consecutive_failures probes failed in a row
# HELP dbhealth_probe_latency_ms the last probe's round trip
# HELP dbhealth_probe_ok 1 when the last probe answered
# HELP dbhealth_replication_lag_seconds how far behind this endpoint is
# HELP dbhealth_replication_replica_lag_seconds a replica's lag as its primary sees it
# HELP dbhealth_replication_slot_active 1 when a consumer is connected to the slot
# HELP dbhealth_replication_slot_behind_bytes WAL the slot's consumer has not confirmed
# HELP dbhealth_replication_slot_lost 1 when the server removed WAL the slot needs
# HELP dbhealth_replication_slot_retained_bytes WAL the slot keeps on disk
# HELP dbhealth_replication_slot_safe_wal_bytes WAL the server can write before the slot is at risk
# HELP dbhealth_size_bytes the database on disk, WAL not included
# HELP dbhealth_table_dead_rows rows deleted or updated and not yet reclaimed
# HELP dbhealth_table_index_scans_per_second index reads
# HELP dbhealth_table_newest_at_seconds max of the freshness column, Unix seconds
# HELP dbhealth_table_rows rows, estimated unless dbhealth_table_rows_exact is 1
# HELP dbhealth_table_rows_deleted_per_second rows deleted, from the table's own counter
# HELP dbhealth_table_rows_exact 1 when dbhealth_table_rows is a count(*)
# HELP dbhealth_table_rows_inserted_per_second rows inserted, from the table's own counter
# HELP dbhealth_table_rows_updated_per_second rows updated, from the table's own counter
# HELP dbhealth_table_schema_changes columns added, dropped or retyped since the last report
# HELP dbhealth_table_seq_scans_per_second whole-table reads
# HELP dbhealth_table_size_bytes the table on disk
# HELP dbhealth_tables tables in the database's own schemas, partitions included
# HELP dbhealth_wal_bytes the write-ahead log on disk, for the whole server
